g></span>\nWe want to disprove this statement. In other words, we must show that its negation is true:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"44.17ex\" height=\"3.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 19017.7 1439.2\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n\\neg \\big( \\forall n \\in \\mathbb{Z}, \\: 2 \\mid n^2-3\\big) \\: \\equiv \\: \\exists n \\in \\mathbb{Z}, \\: 2 \\not\\mid n^2-3\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-AC\" d=\"M56 323T56 336T70 356H596Q603 353 611 343V102Q598 89 591 89Q587 89 584 90T579 94T575 98T572 102L571 209V316H70Q56 323 56 336Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJSZ1-28\" d=\"M152 251Q152 646 388 850H416Q422 844 422 841Q422 837 403 816T357 753T302 649T255 482T236 250Q236 124 255 19T301 -147T356 -251T403 -315T422 -340Q422 -343 416 -349H388Q359 -325 332 -296T271 -213T212 -97T170 56T152 251Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2200\" d=\"M0 673Q0 684 7 689T20 694Q32 694 38 680T82 567L126 451H430L473 566Q483 593 494 622T512 668T519 685Q524 694 538 694Q556 692 556 674Q556 670 426 329T293 -15Q288 -22 278 -22T263 -15Q260 -11 131 328T0 673ZM414 410Q414 411 278 411T142 410L278 55L414 410Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-6E\" d=\"M21 287Q22 293 24 303T36 341T56 388T89 425T135 442Q171 442 195 424T225 390T231 369Q231 367 232 367L243 378Q304 442 382 442Q436 442 469 415T503 336T465 179T427 52Q427 26 444 26Q450 26 453 27Q482 32 505 65T540 145Q542 153 560 153Q580 153 580 145Q580 